                <pb facs="0837" n="831" xml:id="pg831"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">123 Fish, Bert/217: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister to Saudi Arabia</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Fish</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Djedda</hi></placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-outside-research" calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-02-04">undated</date>.<lb/>[Received February 5, 1940—10:10
                        a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Presented credentials to King here yesterday and had informal audience today.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fish</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
